@guide H_BloodElf_Ghostlands
@name Ghostlands (Tranquillien)
@faction Horde
@races BloodElf
@levels 10-20
@zone Ghostlands
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Tranquillien, the three villages, Sanctum of the Moon, the Amani trolls, Windrunner Village and Deatholme. Ends at about 20; go through the Orb of Translocation to the Undercity.
@next H_Barrens

